{"id":1151102,"name":"Evie - Interrogation II","type":"trial","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"Evie - Interrogation II","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1151102]}],"trial":{"trial_id":151102,"stage":"Phase 2","unlock_time":"2026-10-08 14:00:00","diary1":"Evie acknowledges her mistakes, but still hopes to support Mimi-meow at her 365th live performance, an event Evie has spent a long time preparing for. For medical monitoring and investigative purposes, you agree to accompany her.\nThis performance may help you determine whether the idol Evie places her trust in is a callous enabler who exploits her people-pleasing tendencies, or a brilliant star who can genuinely brighten her future and guide her out of the dark.","diary2":"At the venue, fans shoulder a massive workload that should have fallen to the talent agency. Evie pushes through her illness and delivers the surprise she has prepared onto the stage.\nBut this gift she treasures is publicly rejected by Mimi-meow. Rushing backstage, you and Evie even overhear Mimi-meow dismissing Evie's efforts. The shock causes Evie to collapse on the spot. It seems that Mimi-meow has betrayed your expectations and turned out to be just another pitiless idol who exploits her fans... or is she?","evidence":[{"ID":260981,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260982,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":251102001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":251102002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":251102003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":3,"dialogue_id":251102004,"next":[5]},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":251102005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":251102006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":251102007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":251102008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":251102009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":251102010,"next":null},{"step":11